// LONGBOW_SPAWN_IN :
"P1248181840" "Back up has arrived, take down those Shivans!"
// LONGBOW_SPAWN_IN :
"P2018325943" "Brace yourselves!"
// LONGBOW_SPAWN_IN :
"P1001597561" "We need to buy the others some time!"
// LONGBOW_SPAWN_IN :
"P3142397230" "The city might be lost, but we won't let you monsters take any more lives!"
// LONGBOW_SPAWN_IN :
"P1778353050" "Focus your fire, we're getting through this!"
// LONGBOW_SPAWN_IN :
"P1456579313" "You monsters won't get away with this, I swear it!"
// LONGBOW_SPAWN_IN :
"P1542239166" "I'll fight for Galaxy until I draw my last breath!"

// ARACHNOS_SPAWN_IN :
"P1383454591" "Orders straight from the top, take down the Shivans on the ground, they're the number one priority."
// ARACHNOS_SPAWN_IN :
"P3488945413" "Hrmph, figures Longbow couldn't do this themselves!"
// ARACHNOS_SPAWN_IN :
"P184911255" "For Lord Recluse! For Arachnos!"
// ARACHNOS_SPAWN_IN :
"P2013946793" "We'll rebuild this pile of junk in the image of Arachnos, once we take care of these Shivans!"
// ARACHNOS_SPAWN_IN :
"P2620792414" "Strike team has arrived, engaging Shivans!"
// ARACHNOS_SPAWN_IN :
"P1576982501" "Move in, surround the Shivans!"
// ARACHNOS_SPAWN_IN :
"P1460999881" "We survive this and we'll get promoted to Huntsmen!"

